LOCATION:Casuarina\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1410
DESCRIPTION:I ndian Art: History and Appreciation Course by Art Historian
 \, Prof. Benoy K Behl . A journey through Indian art\, across ancient and
  medieval times\, profusely illustrated by Prof. Behl's well-known photog
 raphs and films on Indian art. For registrations and details\, write to p
